<title>USA: CSP names Alexander Lupinetti CEO.</title>
<headline>CSP names Alexander Lupinetti CEO.</headline>
<dateline>BILLERICA, Mass. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>CSP Inc said on Monday the company hired Alexander Lupinetti as its president and chief executive effective September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Lupinetti, a former vice president of sales at Stratus Computer Inc, will also become a member of the company's board of directors, CSP said.</p>
<p>David Botten was previously the company's president and chief executive, a company spokeswoman said. He left the position in February, she said.</p>
